{
    "title": "Mureka - AI Song&Music Maker",
    "description": "Mureka is a cutting-edge AI music generator that empowers everyone\u2014whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned musician\u2014to create unique music effortlessly. With AI technology, you can generate songs tailored to your style, from pop to funk, electronic to jazz. Just a few taps, and you\u2019ll be crafting high-quality music like a pro!\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- AI-Powered Music Creation: Generate personalized music based on your preferences, across various genres such as pop, electronic, hip-hop, jazz, and more.\r\n- Easy to Use: With a simple and intuitive interface, anyone can create complete lyrics, beautiful melodies, no music theory required.\r\n- Customizable Preferences: Style, moods, instruments, and more to create a song that truly represents your unique taste in music.\r\n\r\nMore exclusive features\r\n- Generate similar songs: Upload a reference song, and Mureka will quickly generate a song similar to it, closely matching the music you're looking for.\r\n- Choose your favorite singer to sing: You can specify the gender of the singer and choose a preferred vocal tone, making the vocal part of your song even more captivating.\r\n- Record melodic motifs: Generate songs using recorded melodies. Mureka will use your recording as the melody, with the instrumentation and arrangement built around it.\r\n\r\nWho\u2019s It For?\r\n- Music Lovers: Whether you're a music novice or expert, Mureka helps you create professional-quality tracks effortlessly.\r\n- Content Creators: Ideal for video creators, podcasters, advertising producers, and anyone needing music for their content.\r\n- Musicians: Easily create song demos with Mureka, providing unlimited inspiration for independent musicians' creations.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Mureka?\r\n- Mureka's AI music model is trained on a vast collection of music samples, ensuring that the generated tracks sound professional and innovative.\r\n- Gain full commercial rights to generated songs, ideal for creators wanting to monetize their music or businesses needing original music for promotions.\r\n- Globally distribute your generated original songs to Apple Music, TikTok, YouTube, Spotify, Amazon, Deezer, Napster, Pandora, SoundCloud, and more. Take full advantage of Mureka's powerful promotional resources and marketing support to elevate your music career.\r\n\r\nStart your music journey with Mureka and unlock endless possibilities!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Mureka is a cutting-edge AI music generator that empowers everyone\u2014whether you\u2019re a beginner or a seasoned musician\u2014to create unique music effortlessly. With AI technology, you can generate songs tailored to your style, from pop to funk, electronic to jazz. Just a few taps, and you\u2019ll be crafting high-quality music like a pro!<br><br>Key Features<br>- AI-Powered Music Creation: Generate personalized music based on your preferences, across various genres such as pop, electronic, hip-hop, jazz, and more.<br>- Easy to Use: With a simple and intuitive interface, anyone can create complete lyrics, beautiful melodies, no music theory required.<br>- Customizable Preferences: Style, moods, instruments, and more to create a song that truly represents your unique taste in music.<br><br>More exclusive features<br>- Generate similar songs: Upload a reference song, and Mureka will quickly generate a song similar to it, closely matching the music you&#39;re looking for.<br>- Choose your favorite singer to sing: You can specify the gender of the singer and choose a preferred vocal tone, making the vocal part of your song even more captivating.<br>- Record melodic motifs: Generate songs using recorded melodies. Mureka will use your recording as the melody, with the instrumentation and arrangement built around it.<br><br>Who\u2019s It For?<br>- Music Lovers: Whether you&#39;re a music novice or expert, Mureka helps you create professional-quality tracks effortlessly.<br>- Content Creators: Ideal for video creators, podcasters, advertising producers, and anyone needing music for their content.<br>- Musicians: Easily create song demos with Mureka, providing unlimited inspiration for independent musicians&#39; creations.<br><br>Why Choose Mureka?<br>- Mureka&#39;s AI music model is trained on a vast collection of music samples, ensuring that the generated tracks sound professional and innovative.<br>- Gain full commercial rights to generated songs, ideal for creators wanting to monetize their music or businesses needing original music for promotions.<br>- Globally distribute your generated original songs to Apple Music, TikTok, YouTube, Spotify, Amazon, Deezer, Napster, Pandora, SoundCloud, and more. Take full advantage of Mureka&#39;s powerful promotional resources and marketing support to elevate your music career.<br><br>Start your music journey with Mureka and unlock endless possibilities!",
